# Retest Tools After Changes

When refactoring or updating code in `tools/` or `bin/`, follow this checklist to verify everything works.

## Project Structure

```
tools/
  __init__.py
  gemini/                    # Core Gemini automation tools
    __init__.py
    base.py                  # GeminiBase class (shared browser logic)
    browser.py               # BrowserDaemon (persistent Chrome daemon)
    daemon_start.py          # Background daemon process
    fast_ask.py              # Speed-optimized text chat (ai-ask)
    fast_gem.py              # Speed-optimized Gem chat (ai-gem)
    ask.py                   # Standard text chat (login, fallback)
    image.py                 # Image generation (ai-image)
    veo.py                   # Video generation (ai-veo)
  story/                     # Story scraping & summarization
    __init__.py
    scraper.py               # Chapter scraper (truyenfull.vision)
    summary.py               # Orchestrator: scrape -> gem service -> save
```

## Quick Verification Steps

### 1. Import Check (run first - catches broken imports)

```bash
poetry run python -c "
from tools.gemini.base import GeminiBase
from tools.gemini.browser import BrowserDaemon
from tools.gemini.fast_ask import GeminiFastAsk
from tools.gemini.fast_gem import GeminiFastGem
from tools.gemini.ask import GeminiAsk
from tools.gemini.image import GeminiImage
from tools.gemini.veo import GeminiVeo
from tools.story.scraper import StoryScraper
from tools.story.summary import StorySummary
print('All imports OK')
"
```

### 2. CLI Help Check (verifies argparse and module paths)

```bash
poetry run python -m tools.gemini.fast_ask --help
poetry run python -m tools.gemini.fast_gem --help
poetry run python -m tools.story.summary --help
```

### 3. Daemon Lifecycle

```bash
# Start daemon (via any fast tool)
poetry run python -m tools.gemini.fast_ask --status

# Stop daemon
poetry run python -m tools.gemini.fast_ask --stop
```

### 4. Functional Tests

```bash
# Text chat (fast mode)
ai-ask-debug "hello, just testing"

# Gem chat
ai-gem-debug dcca1e614968 "hello, just testing"

# Story summary (single chapter)
story-get-summary "https://truyenfull.vision/pham-nhan-tu-tien-chi-tien-gioi-thien-pham-nhan-tu-tien-2/chuong-1201/"

# Story summary (batch)
story-get-summary --from 1201 --to 1203 \
  "https://truyenfull.vision/pham-nhan-tu-tien-chi-tien-gioi-thien-pham-nhan-tu-tien-2/"
```

### 5. Shell Script Check

All `bin/` scripts should use `tools.gemini.*` or `tools.story.*` module paths:

| Script | Python Module |
|--------|---------------|
| `ai-ask` | `tools.gemini.fast_ask` (or `tools.gemini.ask` with `--slow`) |
| `ai-ask-debug` | `tools.gemini.fast_ask` (or `tools.gemini.ask` with `--slow`) |
| `ai-gem` | `tools.gemini.fast_gem` |
| `ai-gem-debug` | `tools.gemini.fast_gem` |
| `ai-stop` | `tools.gemini.fast_ask --stop` |
| `ai-image` | `tools.gemini.image` |
| `ai-image-debug` | `tools.gemini.image` |
| `ai-veo` | `tools.gemini.veo` |
| `ai-veo-debug` | `tools.gemini.veo` |
| `story-get-summary` | `tools.story.summary` |

## Key Import Patterns

When adding new files or updating imports:

- **Within `tools/gemini/`**: Use `from tools.gemini.base import GeminiBase`
- **Within `tools/story/`**: Use `from tools.gemini.fast_gem import GeminiFastGem`
- **Cross-package**: `from tools.gemini.browser import BrowserDaemon`
- **SCRIPT_DIR** (project root): `os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))))` (3 levels up from `tools/gemini/`)

## Common Issues

1. **"Could not extract chapter content"**: The scraper tab needs explicit `page.goto()` navigation for each new URL (the daemon reuses tabs).
2. **"Not logged in"**: Run `ai-ask --login "hello"` first to set up the browser session.
3. **"Profile already in use"**: Run `ai-stop` to kill the daemon and orphaned Chrome processes.
4. **Import errors after move**: Check that all `from tools.xxx` imports are updated to `from tools.gemini.xxx` or `from tools.story.xxx`.
